# Tix language, tensor IR, evaluators, meaning contract and checked passes

This ticket introduces Tix as the second domain on the v6 framework. The design is ready for review. Implementation follows the review in this session.

- [Design and proposed framework change](design-doc/01-tix-semantics-and-checked-tensor-rewrites.md)
- [Diary and probe results](reference/01-implementation-diary.md)
- [Tasks](tasks.md)
